## Directory Structure

| Directory | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `BOM/{{.Revision}}/` | Bill of Materials files |
| `Datasheets/` | Component datasheets |
| `DRC/` | Design Rule Check reports |
| `ERC/` | Electrical Rule Check reports |
| `ECO/` | Engineering Change Orders |
| `PCB/{{.Revision}}/` | PCB design files |
| `Original_Files/` | Client submissions and source files |
| `Reports/` | DFM analysis and review reports |
| `IQC/` | Incoming Quality Control |
| `DFT/` | Design for Test |
| `SOP/` | Standard Operating Procedures |
| `scripts/` | Automation and utility scripts |

## Getting Started

1. Place original design files in `Original_Files/`
2. Run DFM analysis: `parts dfm`
3. Review generated reports in `Reports/`

## Source Parts CLI

This project uses the Source Parts CLI for DFM operations.

```bash
# Check project status
parts status

# Run DFM analysis
parts dfm

# Generate reports
parts report
```

For more information, visit [source.parts](https://source.parts)
